# _headers.tmpl — TEMPLATE FILE. Do not edit _headers directly; edit this file.
# Rendered by scripts/inject-csp-hashes.mjs after npm run build:astro.
# Static headers go to _headers and dist/_headers. The full CSP is written to
# dist/data/content-security-policy.json and embedded before scripts in static HTML.
# frame-ancestors stays in a short header; page views do not invoke Workers.
# {{SCRIPT_HASHES}} and {{STYLE_HASHES}} are replaced with space-separated sha256-... tokens.
# Compatibility policy: the published GTM container uses dynamic Custom HTML tags
# and Custom JavaScript variables. Permit script elements and eval, but keep inline
# event handlers blocked and external scripts restricted to reviewed provider hosts.
# Public pages remain static; no per-request nonce or Worker is needed.
